#: routes/splash.py:26
msgid "Never sing again... ever."
msgstr "拜託…以後別再唱了。"

#: routes/splash.py:27
msgid "That was a really good impression of a dying cat!"
msgstr "這是在模仿垂死的貓嗎？好像喔！"

#: routes/splash.py:28
msgid "Thank God it's over."
msgstr "謝天謝地，終於唱完了。"

#: routes/splash.py:29
msgid "Pass the mic, please!"
msgstr "麥克風請交給下一位！"

#: routes/splash.py:30
msgid "Well, I'm sure you're very good at your day job."
msgstr "嗯…我相信你的正職一定做得很好。"

#: routes/splash.py:33
msgid "I've seen better."
msgstr "我聽過更好的。"

#: routes/splash.py:34
msgid "Ok... just ok."
msgstr "還行…就還行。"

#: routes/splash.py:35
msgid "Not bad for an amateur."
msgstr "以業餘來說不錯了。"

#: routes/splash.py:36
msgid "You put on a decent show."
msgstr "表現得還不錯。"

#: routes/splash.py:37
msgid "That was... something."
msgstr "這真是…很特別。"

#: routes/splash.py:40
msgid "Congratulations! That was unbelievable!"
msgstr "恭喜！太不可思議了！"

#: routes/splash.py:41
msgid "Wow, have you tried auditioning for The Voice?"
msgstr "哇，有沒有考慮去參加《聲林之王》？"

#: routes/splash.py:42
msgid "Please, sing another one!"
msgstr "拜託，再唱一首！"

#: routes/splash.py:43
msgid "You rock! You know that?!"
msgstr "你超強的！你知道嗎？！"

#: routes/splash.py:44
msgid "Woah, who let Freddie Mercury in here?"
msgstr "哇，是誰把天王請來了？"

